        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Φ(t1; t0, x0, u), time range [t0, t1], initial set X0, and",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        126.35099029541016,
        558.00439453125,
        136.6698760986328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "disturbance set D, the random variables X0 and D, and an",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        138.30599975585938,
        557.9996337890625,
        149.42388916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "accuracy level ϵ ∈(0, 1), compute a set ˆR[t0,t1] such that",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        148.30091857910156,
        558.0043334960938,
        161.68389892578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "µ( ˆR[t0,t1]) ≥1 −ϵ.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        161.27992248535156,
        392.6626892089844,
        174.47332763671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Selecting a set with high measure under µ is not sufﬁcient",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        175.80690002441406,
        557.9993896484375,
        184.87286376953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to ensure a reasonable estimate, since the trivial solution",
      "bbox": [
        313.2000732421875,
        187.92132568359375,
        558.0010986328125,
        196.827880859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ˆR[t0,t1] = Rn satisﬁes µ( ˆR[t0,t1]) = 1. To avoid this problem",
      "bbox": [
        313.2000732421875,
        196.2613525390625,
        557.99560546875,
        210.39337158203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we require some regularization, such as requiring that ˆR[t0,t1]",
      "bbox": [
        313.20013427734375,
        210.1779327392578,
        557.4996948242188,
        223.37237548828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "be compact and penalizing estimates with high volume.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20013427734375,
        224.81134033203125,
        541.3436279296875,
        233.7178955078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "B. Christoffel Functions",
      "bbox": [
        313.20013427734375,
        244.03802490234375,
        412.547119140625,
        252.6257781982422
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Given a ﬁnite measure µ on Rn and a positive integer k,",
